[{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1058:b004:l022","ordinal":156929,"en":"Such was his wisdom:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1058:b004:l023","ordinal":156930,"en":"\"He will send the pretentious Kozho"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1058:b004:l024","ordinal":156931,"en":"Over the hill,\" he thought;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1058:b004:l025","ordinal":156932,"en":"\"This pig who struck from above"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1058:b004:l026","ordinal":156933,"en":"Will be left disgraced.\""},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1058:b004:l027","ordinal":156934,"en":"As he was about to make the tale compelling,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1058:b004:l028","ordinal":156935,"en":"Toltoy and Chynkozho,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1058:b004:l029","ordinal":156936,"en":"And the swarming Zhediger—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1058:b004:l030","ordinal":156937,"en":"As he was now about to deceive them,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1058:b004:l031","ordinal":156938,"en":"\"God has taken the fool;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1058:b004:l032","ordinal":156939,"en":"He has begun the ruin now,\" he thought."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1058:b004:l033","ordinal":156940,"en":"Azhybay struggled to intervene,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1058:b004:l034","ordinal":156941,"en":"Quarreling with Tümönbay."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1058:b004:l035","ordinal":156942,"en":"Raging and straining,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1058:b004:l036","ordinal":156943,"en":"From the other side Chynkozho"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1058:b004:l037","ordinal":156944,"en":"Now stood surging forward,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1058:b004:l038","ordinal":156945,"en":"Beating the earth as he strained,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1058:b004:l039","ordinal":156946,"en":"And surging in anger."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b003:l001","ordinal":156947,"en":"Toward devil-ridden Kozho,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b003:l002","ordinal":156948,"en":"He now stood surging,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b003:l003","ordinal":156949,"en":"And spoke to Tümönbay:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b003:l004","ordinal":156950,"en":"\"You are a hero, Tümönbay;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b003:l005","ordinal":156951,"en":"Your heroism has become clear."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b003:l006","ordinal":156952,"en":"Like a wolf among sheep,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b003:l007","ordinal":156953,"en":"Your ferocity has become clear."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b003:l008","ordinal":156954,"en":"Among your many devils,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b003:l009","ordinal":156955,"en":"Your greatness has become clear."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b003:l010","ordinal":156956,"en":"Like iron placed in fire,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b003:l011","ordinal":156957,"en":"Your hardness has become clear."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b003:l012","ordinal":156958,"en":"You have surged too far, Tümönbay;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b003:l013","ordinal":156959,"en":"Have you brought on my rage?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b003:l014","ordinal":156960,"en":"Accursed Afghan,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b003:l015","ordinal":156961,"en":"Shall I cut one of you down!\""},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b003:l016","ordinal":156962,"en":"Chynkozho stood surging,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b003:l017","ordinal":156963,"en":"And put on armor no bullet pierced;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b003:l018","ordinal":156964,"en":"If you had seen Chynkozho,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b003:l019","ordinal":156965,"en":"He strained like a blue bull."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b003:l020","ordinal":156966,"en":"He made ready to take up"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b003:l021","ordinal":156967,"en":"His golden-edged battle-axe;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b003:l022","ordinal":156968,"en":"He roared in anger,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b003:l023","ordinal":156969,"en":"Shouting the cry, \"Alaman!\""},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b003:l024","ordinal":156970,"en":"Tölök struggled there,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b003:l025","ordinal":156971,"en":"Quarreling with Chynkozho:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b003:l026","ordinal":156972,"en":"\"Fool struck from above!\""},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b003:l027","ordinal":156973,"en":"When pure God was about to grant"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b003:l028","ordinal":156974,"en":"The rattling Afghans to you,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b003:l029","ordinal":156975,"en":"When the Afghans, drawn by the spectacle,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b003:l030","ordinal":156976,"en":"Were now about to come before you,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b003:l031","ordinal":156977,"en":"Why did God strike you"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b003:l032","ordinal":156978,"en":"So you reel in frenzy?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b003:l033","ordinal":156979,"en":"If you speak evil words again,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b003:l034","ordinal":156980,"en":"Will a living soul not move in anger?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b003:l035","ordinal":156981,"en":"After Aychürök is given in tribute,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b003:l036","ordinal":156982,"en":"Will poor Tümönbay not burn with shame?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b003:l037","ordinal":156983,"en":"When matters were about to enter agreement,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b003:l038","ordinal":156984,"en":"When they were about to give their maiden"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b003:l039","ordinal":156985,"en":"As tribute before you,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b005:l001","ordinal":156986,"en":"You prove a foolish man;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b005:l002","ordinal":156987,"en":"Why did God strike you?\""},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b005:l003","ordinal":156988,"en":"Speaking such words,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b005:l004","ordinal":156989,"en":"He spoke many words that humbled"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b005:l005","ordinal":156990,"en":"Kozho, son of Shygay."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b005:l006","ordinal":156991,"en":"Raging and making him strain,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b005:l007","ordinal":156992,"en":"What could dear Tölök do?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b005:l008","ordinal":156993,"en":"He held Kozho, son of Shygay,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b005:l009","ordinal":156994,"en":"And kept him struggling."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b005:l010","ordinal":156995,"en":"Clinging without releasing him,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b005:l011","ordinal":156996,"en":"Grappling with Tümönbay,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b005:l012","ordinal":156997,"en":"They stopped between the sides,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b005:l013","ordinal":156998,"en":"And bristled at one another."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b005:l014","ordinal":156999,"en":"Stopping in the space between,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b005:l015","ordinal":157000,"en":"They cursed one another aloud;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b005:l016","ordinal":157001,"en":"Unable to reach each other,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b005:l017","ordinal":157002,"en":"They fought with their mouths."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b005:l018","ordinal":157003,"en":"Displaying his superiority,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b005:l019","ordinal":157004,"en":"Tölök brought Kozho, son of Shygay,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b005:l020","ordinal":157005,"en":"To heed his words."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b005:l021","ordinal":157006,"en":"Displaying his eloquence,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b005:l022","ordinal":157007,"en":"Azhybay barely brought"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b005:l023","ordinal":157008,"en":"Tümönbay to heed his words."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b005:l024","ordinal":157009,"en":"Deceiving him all the while, Azhybay"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b005:l025","ordinal":157010,"en":"Had Tümönbay mounted"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b005:l026","ordinal":157011,"en":"On his black-blazed thoroughbred."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b005:l027","ordinal":157012,"en":"Tümönbay came to a halt."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b005:l028","ordinal":157013,"en":"These two among the Zhediger"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b005:l029","ordinal":157014,"en":"Made an entertaining tale of it;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b005:l030","ordinal":157015,"en":"Tümönbay, son of Tülkü,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b005:l031","ordinal":157016,"en":"Was left with a bad name."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b005:l032","ordinal":157017,"en":"Trampling the ground he walked,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b005:l033","ordinal":157018,"en":"They spoke ill of Tümönbay."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b005:l034","ordinal":157019,"en":"Azhybay, son of Azhy,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b005:l035","ordinal":157020,"en":"Was a swift-tongued eloquent servant,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b005:l036","ordinal":157021,"en":"A son who found sound arguments;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b005:l037","ordinal":157022,"en":"When he acted with wisdom,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b005:l038","ordinal":157023,"en":"For the entire world"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1059:b005:l039","ordinal":157024,"en":"He was a servant beyond price."}]
